# Every text file in this repo is stored with LF. Without a rule per extension,
# core.autocrlf=true checks out .html/.js/.css/.md as CRLF on Windows, and the
# first text-mode rewrite of one of them commits a whole-file diff.
#
# text=auto, not text: git still sniffs the content, so a binary that arrives
# without a rule below is left alone instead of being line-endian-converted.
* text=auto eol=lf
*.png binary
*.ico binary
*.gz binary
*.bin binary
*.pyc binary
